    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第18篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnG3TT0uydRyicQf36sBVicicfIqMGCpGw77AlRKBucVdn0xF3eZE9TrfEjW94ZQbqEBOwYk4bHvyRZetUCymKxe2QaQpyghyooVc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.41215226939970717\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2732\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001366\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近大模型那么多，到底哪个更适合普通白领呢？</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">今天我们就拿白领最常遇到的读文档、核对数据、做活动页面这些场景来测试一下。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些场景大模型表现如何，光看跑分根本选不出来。我们直接拿我一个做营销的朋友的真活儿上手，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">把 MiniMax M3、DeepSeek V4 Pro、Kimi 2.7、Gemini 3.5 Flash 摆到一起各跑一遍。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">看看这种典型的办公室白领的工作，哪个模型更能打？</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmntLzaibibR6MaXprAicy6mxWLPlGyBOFI5tbdeSUb33icNnbcSKgxulXSV56V4aqISsnaIz7L46WZEVMVPvlaPjCLfMZIkXLO3C0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.15121255349500715\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1402\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001364\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">案例实测</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">朋友有个咖啡品牌叫山野咖啡，主打云南保山产地豆和冷萃工艺，走的是产地故事加质价比路线，价位卡在瑞幸和星巴克中间。最近她要做一个活动营销方案，并且需要看到活动落地页的效果，我们一步一步走完这个流程。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一步：读参考资料出方案</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">朋友给我了这个项目的参考资料，2 张友商活动页长截图，另外还有一份15万字188页的山野咖啡产品文档及用户访谈摘录（脱敏）。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkk5xmyBKCTTKib3x1HzSOSTy6jSHERZwKmkZfXbjQSn49N1RQwMlJBRl9A3FqrbmURvpyVbhXkRiaia7giaS84K09TicAb5xuRf6nY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9459459459459459\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1628\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001365\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些资料靠人一条条看完再提炼，半天时间就没了。我想看看模型能不能读懂复杂的长图和这15万字的文档，还能根据这些资料，直接给出一版能用的活动页方案。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我直接在4个模型中都输入同样的内容：</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnsrwtctAiaOwmc0hhel0JkByeyb0uclV3SI9ZhoPcRrp93hz28o3ha12iaibqB8F4MxhE4KS0msA5ophXgVa0ebelwVBvzV6Ryb0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.22580645161290322\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1488\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001363\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek V4 Pro</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek可以同时处理截图和长文档，产出的方案也精准兼顾了高级调性与硬核卖点，用低饱和视觉与情绪文案维持品牌审美，用18.8元定价、0糖0脂、科学工艺及空瓶回收玩法，直击用户痛点并巧妙促成高裂变与高复购。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCmoYH059ppt5aJPxsob6qLsmZGfhfRja2TKQzLicTQSqTUuDACQrnJcSxnh4QrZykT2AyMBribJibsSv1Bic9o9bbdAGGDIkArjhGU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.81875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001367\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek可以坦率地承认自己有读不出来的地方，主要是一些小字，细则。整体来说表现还是不错的。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCkyiabeH1ZdajMKVQPnHmqkBgofMcD5S5icog4B2E4aaevyRVKgr9hp0AiaX6Igthiao6X8YdIMnDG20qnUnsichL70A187PnrprmJY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.82625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001371\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Kimi 2.7</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Kimi 长文本是老本行，在长文本阅读上还是非常强的。整个方案基于50条真实用户访谈，避开瑞幸低价与星巴克社交，以产地情绪加慢工艺错位竞争，用硬核数据建立信任，让促销不损调性。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCnkicWQWwibTPv1pqib2mPKmbibW7qatUjrHdHrmbD1OH8bh5Ue00Vy9WqRfFZNNKTAEr3ibZ7G5AIkjETqNMYw26mXST8ib9aNc7D0g/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.71125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001370\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">对于读不清楚的地方，Kimi 2.7很诚实，写得也相对比较清楚。读不清的地方和DeepSeek差不多，主要是一些小字。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClXf3eR6Y12VZELBAdZIN9WxNXLuboUN0AYOLXma0MWEFWjmRFIBNodtkXc7mGXoQcIGXgs9AbdS188ZichunheHwBCkLia3Tfp0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6753246753246753\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1540\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001368\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax M3</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">M3是唯一一个给我输出了完整文档供我下载的，它这个方案的完整程度，是可以直接交给老板看的程度了。方案内容也不错，差异化清晰，用的产地心智战。每条决策都有访谈原话兜底，SKU 只推 3 款很克制，是真的懂营销。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCkGksic0xByYUvMEYnIqaLGueU5hKrl7lOAQSXicCM044icuyiaPPWzDjY3ggg5FlxqT4NJslOvDaYTmwSzfwEBAYXCUn60QWUUU4w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.645\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001369\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">关于长截图，MiniMax M3很诚实地告诉我它只能读清80%，哪些是读不清楚的，什么原因造成的，都列得清清楚楚。其实我不怕大模型读不清，就怕它读不清还瞎编。这一点MiniMax M3确实做得不错。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCl3vJ0eBx5KYQMev3fjia0XlnTIbFqIEoxvlA5oibFibsUnA994CPXkuKlr06joseFczribnpPHR5C3p8HEzpBAhyROpUWhIp041vI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9325\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001372\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Gemini 3.5 Flash</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Gemini 3.5 Flash 主打快和多模态，作为海外参照，图文理解的综合精度、中文文档和咖啡用户反馈把握得也比较准确，速度也确实更快。方案精准兼顾了高级调性与硬核卖点，整体表现还是不错的。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KClmbhZUxUnARHvWUT0azMjkmy81RjsuOygwnNaXaJbWkv8Gn88TfJYWSbevlv9go4ibLuOpIljM2gSUAkWZCBqWzWDjlvPqm0aM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.94375\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001376\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Gemini 3.5 Flash对于对不清的地方就写得相对比较笼统了。也没有一个大致的能读清的比重，我就不好一下子非常直观地知道它到底懂读了多少。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnLMlQicFrhwcez4f5G2uZHPUK2b4IH2fCYnzdsQ2Xoh7J2OcJdHyXRicibuBRSZAhMdlwoE1uHYWVvjecV67e9YcP5fWCPq6s1Eo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7010178117048346\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1572\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100001373\" data-aistatus=\"1\